### Student Results API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/student
@authToken = your-jwt-token-here

### Get Current Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/results/current
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Past Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/results/past
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Current GPA
GET {{baseUrl}}/results/gpa
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Overall CGPA
GET {{baseUrl}}/results/cgpa
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Results (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/results?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Results by Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/results?session_id=uuid-here&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Results by Semester
GET {{baseUrl}}/results?semester=First&limit=15
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Results by Course
GET {{baseUrl}}/results?course_id=uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
